# Push live after changes

When you finish website or content work in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant files (do not commit secrets or `.env`).
2. Push to `origin` `main` so GitHub Pages updates https://sam-zionsolutions.com.
3. Use remote `techsavvy1982-crypto/sam-zionsolutions`. Never use the St. Paul’s GitHub account.

Treat this as a standing request. Do not wait for “push” or “go ahead” after a completed change.
